      "content": "hey, im working on a screenplay for a gritty crime thriller. i need help with some world building. can u write a really vivid, atmospheric description of a part of a city that feels dangerous and shows a lot of social decay/tension? i want the reader to feel like they shouldn't be there. make it feel real and heavy.",
